  "student_passage": "On Friday, Leo's class wrote postcards to a class on Green Island. Their teacher, Ms Lin, put the finished cards in a large envelope. She planned to post it after school. Leo offered to carry it to the office, where a member of staff would collect the school mail.\n\nAt the office door, Leo found a card on the floor. It was Mia's postcard. He returned to the classroom with it before giving the envelope to the office. Mia thanked him and added her card to the others. The class did not need a new envelope. Leo then took the complete set to the office, and Ms Lin posted it that afternoon.",
